  "description": "The Chois are a family whose people have sacrificed daughters in exchange for wealth and prosperity for generations. Having made a promise with an unknown man, the family has considered the birth of a girl a taboo for many years, in fear of losing their wealth… This is the Asian fantasy tale of the only girl born into the Choi family! \n\n(Source: Copin Comics)",
